            <ArticleTitle>Abdominal pain in childhood.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>347-8, 351, 354-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An interplay of factors is involved in the problem of recurrent abdominal pain. An adequate history and a sympathetic and supportive approach to both the patient and their family are important as is encouragement to avoid illness behaviour. A number of important organic causes need also to be borne in mind.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
